From: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:47:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chore: Delete buildroot.diff in preparation for new QEMU-based development root

Signed-off-by: Felicitas Pojtinger <felicitas@pojtinger.com>
---
diff --git a/buildroot.diff b/buildroot.diff
deleted file mode 100644
index 8fe9bebed98511c6302206b66f6602f1568c53b5..0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
--- a/buildroot.diff
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,766 +0,0 @@
-diff --git a/buildroot-ext/PORT-NOTES.md b/buildroot-ext/PORT-NOTES.md
-new file mode 100644
-index 0000000..45d8721
---- /dev/null
-+++ b/buildroot-ext/PORT-NOTES.md
-@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
-+# K3 port notes
-+
-+This tree is SpaceMiT's external tree with our K3 changes. The companion diff records them.
-+
-+Base: SpaceMiT `buildroot-ext` commit `e4f708f` (tag `k3-br-v1.0.2`).
-+SpaceMiT branch state on 2026-10-28: `buildroot` tip `06a303b` (2026-02-21), `buildroot-ext` tip `6b13807` (2026-09-17).
-+
-+## Inputs
-+
-+- buildroot source: upstream tag `2026.08` or newer. Our tree holds upstream master from mid-2026 with `BR2_VERSION = 2026.08-git`.
-+- external tree: this tree.
-+- kernel: `bsp-src/linux-6.18` at `0ffac20d9ef93c572b649037213bbe20ef59a714`.
-+- u-boot: `bsp-src/uboot-2022.10` at `6747f87ae4cd359ff6e22daa38b06c3ecc2fecb4`.
-+- opensbi: `bsp-src/opensbi` at `e5fc30394ac18263fa045dcaef52f86f180ed512`.
-+- toolchain: prebuilt tarball `http://archive.spacemit.com/toolchain/spacemit-toolchain-linux-glibc-x86_64-v1.2.2.tar.xz`, GCC 15.2.0.
-+
-+## Excluded on purpose
-+
-+- `board/spacemit/k3/target_overlay/lib/firmware/powervr/rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw`: proprietary microcode, 131072 bytes, sha256 `1db1c399c17401d1f79d46c880db81c724d748c784d4639433b076aba2f9c0d2`. Fetch it as `board/spacemit/k3/target_overlay/lib/firmware/powervr/FETCH-FIRMWARE.md` describes.
-+- `board/spacemit/k3/target_overlay/root/.ssh/authorized_keys`: two ed25519 public keys. Add your own key instead.
-+
-+## Build
-+
-+    make O=$PWD/output/k3 BR2_EXTERNAL=$PWD/buildroot-ext BR2_DL_DIR=$PWD/buildroot/dl BR2_CCACHE_DIR=$PWD/buildroot-ccache -j14
-+
-+Set `BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR="$(BR2_EXTERNAL_Bianbu_PATH)/patches"` exactly once.
-+Do not list the same patch directory twice. Buildroot exits with `duplicate filename`.
-+
-+## Pitfalls
-+
-+- Buildroot applies patches with `patch -F0`. Write patches with full context.
-+- A failed patch leaves an entry in `output/k3/build/<pkg>/.applied_patches_list`. Delete that build directory before a retry.
-+- Mesa option names differ between releases. Read `package/mesa3d/Config.in` in the new tag.
-+- Weston patches `0001` and `0002` are dropped. Keep `0003` only.
-+- `linux.mk` needs no patch on the clean tree. Use `LINUX_OVERRIDE_SRCDIR`.
-+
-+## Verify
-+
-+- The image boots with console on `ttyS0` and `tty1`.
-+- `vulkaninfo` lists the imagination device.
-+- `eglinfo` works over zink.
-+- Weston shows the Terminal and GPU Cube Demo launchers.
-diff --git a/buildroot-ext/board/spacemit/k3/dracut-modules/99custom/module-setup.sh b/buildroot-ext/board/spacemit/k3/dracut-modules/99custom/module-setup.sh
-index 03b1683..3df9658 100755
---- a/buildroot-ext/board/spacemit/k3/dracut-modules/99custom/module-setup.sh
-+++ b/buildroot-ext/board/spacemit/k3/dracut-modules/99custom/module-setup.sh
-@@ -13,6 +13,14 @@ depends() {
- 
- # called by dracut
- install() {
-+    # Ensure bare-name binary lookup works regardless of the host build
-+    # environment's PATH. Under a direct (non-container) build the inherited
-+    # PATH may lack the standard sbin/bin dirs, which makes dracut-install's
-+    # name-based resolution silently fail for -o (optional) binaries such as
-+    # mount/blkid/fsck/e2fsck. Missing these leaves the initramfs unable to
-+    # mount the rootfs, hanging the boot with no console output.
-+    PATH="/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin:$PATH"
-+
-     inst_multiple -o ps grep more cat rm strace free showmount \
-         ping netstat rpcinfo vi scp ping6 ssh \
-         fsck fsck.ext2 fsck.ext4 fsck.ext3 fsck.ext4dev fsck.f2fs fsck.vfat e2fsck resize2fs mount blkid
